  "annexD": {
    "title": "Annex D — Digital Play Conventions",
    "precedence": "These are the conventions of this digital client: how it times, shows and confirms the game, where a table of players would simply agree. They are not rules of Algomancy. Where a convention here and a rule in the main document both speak to the game itself, the main document governs. Where they concern only how the client presents, times or confirms play, this annex governs.",
